{"step_index":962,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-27T03:01:25Z","thinking":"**Focusing on Instructions Received**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on the explicit user directive. My key objective is to ensure I adhere precisely to the instruction of exclusively using the provided JPG images for the app insertion. The user's directness is appreciated.\n\n\n**Analyzing Image Replacements**\n\nI'm now methodically reviewing `index.html`, identifying SVG paths, and planning the direct substitution with the provided JPGs. I've begun mapping out images for each activity, starting with \"Chọn trang phục thoải mái.\" I'm cataloging each scene and state's corresponding JPG for precise insertion.\n\n\n**Mapping Image Associations**\n\nI'm now associating specific JPGs to corresponding states within the provided activities. Activity 1's shirt, pants, and full outfit states are now linked to their respective image file paths. I've also begun to identify image resources for Activity 2, Activity 3, Activity 5, and Activity 6, understanding that some may be in SVG format.\n\n\n**Identifying Image Sources**\n\nI am now identifying the specific image files needed for Activities 7 through 12. I've successfully mapped the provided JPG paths to each activity's intro and gameplay, noting the recurring use of the cabin background. This should expedite the image replacement process.\n\n\n**Pinpointing Asset Assignments**\n\nI am now focused on Activity 13, associating the five suitcase JPGs to the correct visual representations. I've successfully cataloged the file paths. I've also pivoted to examining the `character-renderer.js` file, intending to integrate direct JPG sprite switches for Bé Bin's neutral base state.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/**\n * character-renderer.js\n * Renderer sử dụng trực tiếp các file ảnh JPG chuẩn Storybook từ thư mục Artifacts\n */\n\nclass BinCharacterRenderer {\n    constructor() {\n        this.currentOutfit = {\n            shirt: null,\n            pants: null,\n            shoes: null,\n            seatbelt: null\n        };\n\n        const ART_DIR = 'C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/';\n\n        this.sprites = {\n            base: ART_DIR + 'bin_base_neutral_1787728929375.jpg',\n            shirtOnly: ART_DIR + 'bin_yellow_shirt_only_1787728966000.jpg',\n            shirtPants: ART_DIR + 'bin_yellow_shirt_blue_pants_1787728991730.jpg',\n            fullOutfit: ART_DIR + 'bin_yellow_shirt_blue_pants_shoes_1787729023680.jpg'\n        };\n\n        this.containers = new Set();\n\n        if (document.readyState === 'loading') {\n            document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => this.mountAll());\n        } else {\n            this.mountAll();\n        }\n    }\n\n    mountAll() {\n        document.querySelectorAll('[data-bin-character]').forEach(el => {\n            this.renderTo(el);\n        });\n    }\n\n    renderTo(containerOrId) {\n        const container = typeof containerOrId === 'string' ? document.getElementById(containerOrId) : containerOrId;\n        if (!container) return;\n\n        this.containers.add(container);\n        this.updateImage(container);\n    }\n\n    getCurrentImageSrc() {\n        if (this.currentOutfit.shirt && this.currentOutfit.pants && this.currentOutfit.shoes) {\n            return this.sprites.fullOutfit;\n        } else if (this.currentOutfit.shirt && this.currentOutfit.pants) {\n            return this.sprites.shirtPants;\n        } else if (this.currentOutfit.shirt) {\n            return this.sprites.shirtOnly;\n        } else if (this.currentOutfit.pants) {\n            return this.sprites.shirtPants;\n        } else if (this.currentOutfit.shoes) {\n            return this.sprites.fullOutfit;\n        }\n        return this.sprites.base;\n    }\n\n    updateImage(container) {\n        if (!container) return;\n        const src = this.getCurrentImageSrc();\n        container.innerHTML = `\n            <div style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 16px;\">\n                <img src=\"${src}\" alt=\"Bé Bin\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.12));\">\n            </div>\n        `;\n    }\n\n    setShirt(shirtKey) {\n        this.currentOutfit.shirt = shirtKey;\n        this.refreshAll();\n    }\n\n    setPants(pantsKey) {\n        this.currentOutfit.pants = pantsKey;\n        this.refreshAll();\n    }\n\n    setShoes(shoesKey) {\n        this.currentOutfit.shoes = shoesKey;\n        this.refreshAll();\n    }\n\n    setSeatbelt(seatbeltKey) {\n        this.currentOutfit.seatbelt = seatbeltKey;\n        this.refreshAll();\n    }\n\n    reset() {\n        this.currentOutfit = { shirt: null, pants: null, shoes: null, seatbelt: null };\n        this.refreshAll();\n    }\n\n    refreshAll() {\n        this.mountAll();\n        this.containers.forEach(c => this.updateImage(c));\n    }\n}\n\nwindow.binRenderer = new BinCharacterRenderer();\n","Description":"Cập nhật character-renderer.js nạp trực tiếp các file ảnh JPG chuẩn từ Artifacts","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"c:\\Demo.plane\\js\\character-renderer.js","toolAction":"Writing file","toolSummary":"Update character-renderer.js with JPG artifacts"}}]}
